# The tempo turned while the delay is full: the echoes take the new time once ALGO stops, crossfading
# to it, never bending (or clicking) at each detent. Slowly, then a quick spin, then back down; then an
# external clock, whose measured tempo wanders, under the same echoes. Audio in tempoturn.wav.
wait 500
wav tempoturn.wav
tapkey w2
wait 300
tapkey w4
wait 300
tapkey w6
wait 400
turn ALGO 8 120
expect set_bpm 98
tapkey w3
wait 600
turn ALGO 20 20
expect set_bpm 118
wait 600
tapkey w5
turn ALGO -28 30
expect set_bpm 90
wait 1500
tapkey w2
clockin 120 4000
wait 1500
expect ext 1
tapkey w4
wait 2500
wavstop
expect clips 0
